// 2011's spots. Every fishing spot void-634 lists (fishing_spots.tables.toml)
// whose ops in the 647 cache sit where a 289 category's do, and whose catch
// void gives as that category's, takes the category and its hidden ops.
// 289 moves each spot around a list of tiles (fishing_movement_enum); no such
// list is known for these, so they stay where the map puts them.

